[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4861.35, "timestamp": "01:21:01", "text": "クリップ全体を上に載せる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4864.63, "timestamp": "01:21:04", "text": "けれど。私がやったことはクリップ全体ではない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4867.55, "timestamp": "01:21:07", "text": "真ん中だった"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4871.874, "timestamp": "01:21:11", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i'd say you should hard cut to your model when you speak or someone else speaks "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4872.39, "timestamp": "01:21:12", "text": "私、私のモデル、そしてああ、持っていたかもしれない"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4878.122, "timestamp": "01:21:18", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "thats how it usually works for me"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4878.709, "timestamp": "01:21:18", "text": "それ。でも、これはあなたがしたようなことですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4881.03, "timestamp": "01:21:21", "text": "私が投稿した他の動画も見てください。今は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4885.381, "timestamp": "01:21:25", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i did watch those"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4886.709, "timestamp": "01:21:26", "text": "オカはモデルをハードカットすべきだと言う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4889.39, "timestamp": "01:21:29", "text": "あなたが話すとき、または他の人が話すとき"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4892.03, "timestamp": "01:21:32", "text": "ビート"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4894.885, "timestamp": "01:21:34", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i liked the format a lot"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4896.39, "timestamp": "01:21:36", "text": "えーと、限定販売なの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4900.189, "timestamp": "01:21:40", "text": "その川の梯子でできること"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4908.149, "timestamp": "01:21:48", "text": "痛み、なぜなら私はそれを望んでいたから、もしあなたが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4910.709, "timestamp": "01:21:50", "text": "スマホやテレビでこれを見る"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4912.87, "timestamp": "01:21:52", "text": "上部に画面全体が表示され、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4914.629, "timestamp": "01:21:54", "text": "下を見ると私の反応がわかるか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4917.91, "timestamp": "01:21:57", "text": "何かですが、えーと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4919.669, "timestamp": "01:21:59", "text": "コラボレーションのこととなると、"}]